### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/healthz

### Create a workout (reps-based and timed sets)
# @name create
POST http://localhost:3000/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Push day",
  "date": "2026-11-03",
  "exercises": [
    { "name": "Bench press", "sets": [{ "reps": 5, "weightKg": 80 }, { "reps": 5, "weightKg": 80 }] },
    { "name": "Plank", "sets": [{ "durationSec": 60 }, { "durationSec": 45 }] }
  ]
}

### List workouts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/workouts

### Get the workout created above
GET http://localhost:3000/api/workouts/{{create.response.body.workout.id}}

### Delete it
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/workouts/{{create.response.body.workout.id}}